// Conformance fixture for ta.median (S-bead OpenBBTechnical-0e9.5.41, Wave 5B-4).
//
// Author-derivative posture per PRD §7.3: reference output computed by
// hand-computing the sorted-middle-element of a 3-bar window against a
// hard-coded synthetic close series (see ta_median.csv `close` column).
//
// Fixture length = 3 (odd -> unambiguous middle element; PyneCore uses
// window[len//2] after sorting). Warmup: first ``length - 1`` = 2 bars
// are NA.
//@version=6
indicator("smoke_ta_median", overlay=true)
plot(ta.median(close, 3), title="med3")
